(text "Crystal circuit per design guide Sec 4: ABM8-272-T3, 15 pF each side (7.5 pF series + ~3 pF stray = 10.5 pF vs CL 10 pF),\n1 k in the XOUT leg to limit drive with a 50 ohm ESR crystal. C38 is the single design-guide decoupling exception (pins 68+69 share it).\nVREG_AVDD RC = 33 ohm + 4.7 uF (design guide Sec 2.1); VREG_FB is tied to DVDD, VREG_PGND to GND, EP (pin 81) to GND." (at 15 247 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 40add5b4-2d4b-54bc-bd21-cf67b843d6c7))
(text "PORT NAMING: a port label is named for the peripheral pin it comes from, so GPS_TX / ELRS_TX are module outputs\nand land on MCU UART RX pins, while GPS_RX / ELRS_RX are module inputs fed by the MCU UART TX pins.\nJ6/J7/J9 (POWER 3) are 3.3 V logic powered directly from V3V3_SYS." (at 155 238 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 4fe964cf-7b25-57c4-8b0d-4d5819d8a303))
(text "GPIO MAP (pin = QFN-80 pin)\nGPIO0    77  FLASH_CS1    QMI CS1n, log flash select\nGPIO1    78  (no connect) spare\nGPIO2    79  PWM1         PWM1 A\nGPIO3    80  PWM2         PWM1 B\nGPIO4     1  PWM3         PWM2 A\nGPIO5     2  PWM4         PWM2 B\nGPIO6     3  MAG_SDA      I2C1 SDA\nGPIO7     4  MAG_SCL      I2C1 SCL\nGPIO8     6  ELRS_RX      UART1 TX -> radio RX\nGPIO9     7  ELRS_TX      UART1 RX <- radio TX\nGPIO10    8  PWM5         PWM5 A\nGPIO11    9  PWM6         PWM5 B\nGPIO12   11  GPS_RX       UART0 TX -> GPS RX\nGPIO13   12  GPS_TX       UART0 RX <- GPS TX\nGPIO14   13  PWM7         PWM7 A\nGPIO15   14  PWM8         PWM7 B\nGPIO16   16  SENS_MISO    SPI0 RX\nGPIO17   17  HG_ACC_CS    ADXL375 CS\nGPIO18   18  SENS_SCK     SPI0 SCK\nGPIO19   19  SENS_MOSI    SPI0 TX\nGPIO20   20  IMU_ACC_CS   BMI088 CSB1\nGPIO21   21  IMU_GYR_CS   BMI088 CSB2\nGPIO22   22  BARO_CS      BMP581 CSB\nGPIO23   23  IMU_ACC_INT  BMI088 INT1" (at 250 14 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 88d632ec-69b0-536f-826a-26e3a6312b71))
(text "\nGPIO24   25  IMU_GYR_INT  BMI088 INT3\nGPIO25   26  BARO_INT     BMP581 INT\nGPIO26   27  LED_STAT     green status LED\nGPIO27   28  LED_WARN     red warning LED\nGPIO28   36  BUZZ_PWM     buzzer gate drive\nGPIO29   37  HG_ACC_INT   ADXL375 INT1\nGPIO30   38  (no connect) spare\nGPIO31   39  (no connect) spare\nGPIO32   40  SD_CLK       microSD CLK (PIO)\nGPIO33   42  SD_CMD       microSD CMD\nGPIO34   43  SD_D0        microSD DAT0\nGPIO35   44  SD_D1        microSD DAT1\nGPIO36   45  SD_D2        microSD DAT2\nGPIO37   46  SD_D3        microSD DAT3\nGPIO38   47  SD_DET       microSD card detect\nGPIO39   48  (no connect) spare\nGPIO40   49  VIN_SENSE    ADC0, 5V_IN 10k/15k divider\nGPIO41   52  VBUS_SENSE   ADC1, USB_VBUS 10k/15k divider\nGPIO42   53  (no connect) ADC2 spare\nGPIO43   54  (no connect) ADC3 spare\nGPIO44   55  (no connect) ADC4 spare\nGPIO45   56  (no connect) ADC5 spare\nGPIO46   57  (no connect) ADC6 spare\nGPIO47   58  (no connect) ADC7 spare" (at 338 14 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 717e0cb1-cacc-5eeb-aaae-a2c361ed925a))
