(text "J10 pin 1 is 3V3 OUT for debugger reference only - never power the board from it. Pin 10 is the\ndebugger reset line on PWR_GOOD/RUN; pins 6-8 (SWO, KEY, NC) unused. RUN is held by the TPS62913\npower-good pull-up on POWER 2, so the MCU cannot run before V3V3_SYS is in regulation." (at 250 106 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 89426f51-8ff4-5fe9-989c-a17e5b32dbd3))
