(text "Telemetry dividers: 10k/15k gives 3.00 V at 5.00 V in, 3.15 V at 5.25 V; 100 nF at each ADC pin.\nBuzzer runs from V5_SYS (avionics OR output), never from the servo bus; D22 clamps the coil kick.\nQSPI_* are the dedicated QSPI pads: they reach the in-package flash die AND the package pins\n(RP2350 datasheet Sec 14.3), so U24 shares the bus with GPIO0/QMI CS1n (FLASH_CS1) as its select.\nRP2354 requires QSPI_IOVDD = 3.3 V, and IOVDD = 3.3 V to run a second QSPI device (Sec 14.9)." (at 15 258 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 70525436-76b1-5d3e-bf40-f625de835cf3))
